Gnomes can also wand you.

Step one: Get out of the mines ASAP.
Step two: Do the boulder dash (not for STR for a monk) and get food,
rings and wands.

At the last (top) level of the boulder mazes find a boulder that's out
of place and first try on all the rings your pooch will squat on one
at a time to see if the boulder changes either within your line of
sight or just around the corner.

Then write something with your fingers and try overwriting it with
unknown wands in front of the fake boulders.  You are looking for the
wand that changes the text you wrote to all uppercase.  This is the
shift-lock wand.  Zap your 'd' into a 'D' and follow it around as it
eats all the meat that would only get you in trouble anyway.  (Not so
hot for 'f's, but 'u's and the rare pet 'n's and 'l's are fine.)

Even if you didn't get a wand of wishing you still should have a wand
of light that should be used only when you stumble into a combat in
the mines.  Also if your find an amulet at the of the boulder mazes
then wear that so the Gnomes with the wands of deaf can come closer to
listen to your fists.

And best of all there are no traps in the boulder mazes that you
didn't set yourself.  (Well other than the pre-marked puzzle bits.)

